  "title": "Meat and Veggie Stromboli",
  "description": "This meat and veggie stromboli recipe is made with refrigerated bread dough and is filled with pepperoni, Virginia ham, vegetables, and two cheeses.",
  "authors": [
    "Christine Sickeri"
  ],
